  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/earthsemantics/OSO#MARMOR",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/cerif/vocab/Project",
      "http://schema.org/Project",
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "https://w3id.org/earthsemantics/OSO#FundedProject"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "MARMOR (Marine Advanced Geophysical Research Equipment and Mayotte Multidisciplinary Observatory for Research and Response) est un projet d’une durée de huit ans financé par l’ANR.\n\nLe projet MARMOR a un double objectif :\n\nstructurer la communauté scientifique française en fournissant à l’infrastructure de recherche Epos-France (anciennement Résif) les équipements nécessaires pour conduire des recherches d’excellence utilisant les outils de la sismologie et de la géodésie sous-marines,\n\nmettre en place une infrastructure d’observation sous-marine à Mayotte afin d’assurer une surveillance sismologique continue, en temps réel et 24/7, et de conduire des recherches multidisciplinaires sur les phénomènes associés à la crise sismo-volcanique en cours."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MARMOR (Marine Advanced Geophysical Research Equipment and Mayotte Multidisciplinary Observatory for Research and Response) is an eight-year project funded by the ANR.\n\nThe MARMOR project has two objectives:\n\nto structure the French scientific community by providing the Epos-France research infrastructure (formerly Résif) with the equipment required to conduct high-level research using submarine seismology and geodesy tools,\n\nto establish an underwater observation infrastructure in Mayotte in order to ensure continuous, real-time, 24/7 seismological monitoring and to support multidisciplinary research on the phenomena associated with the ongoing seismo-volcanic crisis."
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/title": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Marine Advanced Geophysical Research Equipment and Mayotte Multidisciplinary Observatory for Research and Response (MARMOR)"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Marine Advanced Geophysical Research Equipment and Mayotte Multidisciplinary Observatory for Research and Response (MARMOR)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/logo": [
      {
        "@id": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/emso-eric/oso-ontology/main/images/marmor.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.marmor-project.org/fr"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "no",
        "@value": "MARMOR"
      },
      {
        "@language": "ro",
        "@value": "MARMOR"
      },
      {
        "@language": "el",
        "@value": "MARMOR"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MARMOR"
      },
      {
        "@language": "es",
