        "@value": "Infrastructure régionale EMSO-France Iroise"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EMSO-France Iroise Regional Facility"
      },
      {
        "@language": "pt",
        "@value": "Infraestrutura regional EMSO-France Iroise"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Infrastructure régionale d’EMSO-France située en mer d’Iroise, au large de la Bretagne occidentale, et dédiée à l’observation côtière de l’océan et aux activités de suivi à long terme."
      },
      {
        "@language": "no",
        "@value": "Regional EMSO-France-infrastruktur lokalisert i Iroisehavet, utenfor det vestlige Bretagne, og dedikert til kystnær havobservasjon og langsiktig overvåking."
      },
      {
        "@language": "pt",
        "@value": "Infraestrutura regional do EMSO-France localizada no mar de Iroise, ao largo da Bretanha ocidental, dedicada à observação oceânica costeira e a atividades de monitorização de longo prazo."
      },
      {
        "@language": "el",
        "@value": "Περιφερειακή Εγκατάσταση του EMSO-France που βρίσκεται στη Θάλασσα της Ιρουάζ, στα ανοικτά της δυτικής Βρετάνης, και είναι αφιερωμένη στην παράκτια ωκεάνια παρατήρηση και σε δραστηριότητες μακροχρόνιας παρακολούθησης."
      },
      {
        "@language": "ro",
        "@value": "Infrastructură regională EMSO-France situată în Marea Iroise, în largul Bretaniei occidentale, dedicată observației oceanice costiere și activităților de monitorizare pe termen lung."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Infrastruttura regionale di EMSO-France situata nel Mare d’Iroise, al largo della Bretagna occidentale, dedicata all’osservazione oceanica costiera e ad attività di monitoraggio a lungo termine."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Regional Facility of EMSO-France located in the Iroise Sea, off western Brittany, and dedicated to coastal ocean observation and long-term monitoring activities."
      },
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Infraestructura regional de EMSO-France situada en el mar de Iroise, frente a la Bretaña occidental, dedicada a la observación oceánica costera y a actividades de seguimiento a largo plazo."
      }
    ],
